{"seq":2,"slug":"ddp-deposit-collect-settle","title":"DDP 税费预收、保证金与结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-deposit-collect-settle","wordCount":2273,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"ddp-税费预收-保证金与结算\">DDP 税费预收、保证金与结算</h1><p>DDP 的资金链上有一个容易被会计处理搞错的事实：<strong>下单时向买家收取的那笔税费不是收入</strong>。它是一笔负债——平台欠买家的、用于替他向海关缴税的资金。如果这笔钱被记进毛利，财务报表会显得很好看，直到季度末发现实际缴税额高于预收、差额无处安放。这一篇把 DDP 的资金链拆成四个时点，说明每个时点上钱在哪里、账上是什么科目、以及需要什么样的担保安排来覆盖敞口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>预收税款是负债不是收入</strong>：它是定向用途的资金，必须与营业收入、应付账款分开科目管理，否则会同时高估毛利与低估负债。</li>\n<li><strong>担保覆盖的是可能性而不是既成事实</strong>：进口方需在放行前以担保覆盖可能产生或已经产生的关税债务，额度必须按周期内最大累计敞口而非均值估算。</li>\n<li><strong>担保能力是 DDP 的准入条件</strong>：拿不到额度或成本过高时，DDP 在该市场不可行，无论转化率提升多少。</li>\n<li><strong>预收与实缴必须逐单核销</strong>：按月汇总会让差异归因失去订单粒度，「某品类系统性低估、某口岸系统性重估」这类可修复问题将无法识别。</li>\n<li><strong>垫资成本与担保成本方向相反</strong>：缩短结算周期降低垫资、却提高担保动用频率，优化目标是两者之和最小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"资金链的四个时点\">资金链的四个时点</h2><p>下表先给出全貌，后面逐项展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>钱的位置</th>\n<th>账务性质</th>\n<th>系统动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下单</td>\n<td>买家支付含税总额</td>\n<td>平台收款账户</td>\n<td>形成预收税款负债</td>\n<td>写税费快照、隔离负债</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出运</td>\n<td>生成申报与担保记录</td>\n<td>占用担保额度或垫付</td>\n<td>敞口形成</td>\n<td>登记 guarantee_ref</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关完成</td>\n<td>海关放行、出具税单</td>\n<td>实际缴入海关</td>\n<td>负债按实际金额调整</td>\n<td>写实际税单、建核销记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期末</td>\n<td>与申报方轧差</td>\n<td>划转至申报方</td>\n<td>负债核销</td>\n<td>对账、关账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"时点一-下单-向买家预收\">时点一：下单，向买家预收</h3><p>买家支付含税总额，平台立即获得全部现金。此时税费部分应当被<strong>隔离</strong>——它不是平台可自由支配的营运资金，而是一笔定向用途的负债。隔离在系统上体现为一个独立的负债科目与一个独立的资金池标签，在会计上体现为「预收税款」而非「营业收入」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时点二-出运-向申报方垫付或提供担保\">时点二：出运，向申报方垫付或提供担保</h3><p>货物出运后，报关行或承运商需要向海关保证税款会缴纳。这里的资金安排有两种形态。<strong>实缴垫付</strong>：由平台或申报方在清关时实际支付税款。<strong>担保替代</strong>：由平台或代理向海关提供担保，税款在结算周期末统一缴纳。第二种形态显著改善现金流，但需要担保能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时点三-清关完成-形成实际税单\">时点三：清关完成，形成实际税单</h3><p>海关放行后出具实际应缴金额。这一步产生的是<strong>实际税负</strong>，与预收金额之间几乎必然有差。差异的归因与处置不由本篇负责，见 <a href=\"../duty-variance-reconcile/1-estimate-vs-actual-variance\">预估与实际税费差异</a> 与 <a href=\"../duty-variance-reconcile/over-under-collection-refund\">多收退还与少收补收</a>。本篇关心的是：实际税单到达时，负债科目要按实际金额一次性调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时点四-结算周期末-与申报方轧差\">时点四：结算周期末，与申报方轧差</h3><p>若采用担保加周期结算，平台与报关行/承运商在周期末按累计实际税单轧差。这一环节是全链路唯一需要对账托底的地方，且它跨越了平台与外部机构的边界，因此必须有独立于业务系统的凭证流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保证金与担保-覆盖的是什么\">保证金与担保：覆盖的是什么</h2><p>海关法上的担保不是可选的风控动作，而是制度要求：在货物放行前，进口方需要以担保方式覆盖可能产生或已经产生的关税债务。担保形态包括按次担保与综合担保（覆盖多笔、按额度上限管理）。而担保责任最终落在谁的名下，取决于代理关系形态——直接代理下代理人不为关税债务负责、债务留在委托人，间接代理下代理人承担连带责任（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Customs_broker\">Wikipedia: Customs broker</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"担保额度怎么估\">担保额度怎么估</h3><p>担保额度必须能覆盖周期内的最大累计敞口，而不是平均值。一个可用的估算式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>≥</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>cycle</mtext></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>open</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G \\geq \\max_{\\tau \\in \\text{cycle}} \\sum_{i \\in \\text{open}(\\tau)} \\hat{T}_i \\cdot (1 + \\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cycle</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">open</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为在途订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的预估税额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全裕度，用于吸收改判导致的税额上浮。裕度不能拍脑袋——它应当从历史改判幅度的分位数得到，通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的改判上浮比例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"担保能力是-ddp-的准入条件\">担保能力是 DDP 的准入条件</h3><p>这一条在实践中经常被低估：一个市场如果拿不到担保额度或担保成本高到吃掉毛利，DDP 在该市场就是不可行的，无论转化率提升多少。因此担保成本必须进入成本模型（见 <a href=\"../ddp-experience-ops/ddp-margin-cost-model\">DDP 定价与成本建模</a>），作为一项按在途资金占比计价的变动成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; 已预收: 买家下单支付&#10;  已预收 --&gt; 已出运: 生成申报与担保记录&#10;  已出运 --&gt; 清关中: 申报提交 担保占用额度&#10;  清关中 --&gt; 已缴税: 海关放行 生成实际税单&#10;  清关中 --&gt; 查验中: 抽查或质疑申报价&#10;  查验中 --&gt; 已缴税: 补充材料或改判后放行&#10;  查验中 --&gt; 退运: 无法满足要求&#10;  已缴税 --&gt; 已结算: 周期末与申报方轧差&#10;  已结算 --&gt; [*]&#10;  退运 --&gt; 已退款: 退还买家预收税款 扣除已发生费用&#10;  已退款 --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; 已预收: 买家下单支付\n  已预收 --&gt; 已出运: 生成申报与担保记录\n  已出运 --&gt; 清关中: 申报提交 担保占用额度\n  清关中 --&gt; 已缴税: 海关放行 生成实际税单\n  清关中 --&gt; 查验中: 抽查或质疑申报价\n  查验中 --&gt; 已缴税: 补充材料或改判后放行\n  查验中 --&gt; 退运: 无法满足要求\n  已缴税 --&gt; 已结算: 周期末与申报方轧差\n  已结算 --&gt; [*]\n  退运 --&gt; 已退款: 退还买家预收税款 扣除已发生费用\n  已退款 --&gt; [*]</pre><p>状态机里 <code>退运</code> 分支特别值得注意：货物未进入进口国，理论上不产生关税债务，但担保额度在周期内仍被占用过、报关行仍收取申报服务费，因此退款金额通常小于预收税额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预收税款的账务与系统处理\">预收税款的账务与系统处理</h2><h3 id=\"科目设计\">科目设计</h3><p>预收税费应当在负债侧单列，不与收入、也不与应付账款混同。理由有两条：一是它需要与「实际应缴海关税额」这个独立负债项做逐单核销，混入应付账款会让核销失去依据；二是它在市场放量阶段规模增长很快，单列才能被单独监控。</p>\n<h3 id=\"逐单核销的必要性\">逐单核销的必要性</h3><p>预收与实缴必须<strong>逐单</strong>建立关联，而不是按月汇总。理由是差异归因需要以订单为粒度：只有逐单核对，才能识别出「某个品类系统性低估」「某个口岸系统性重新估价」这类可修复的问题。数据结构上，税费快照（<a href=\"../landed-cost-estimation/landed-cost-component-build\">落地价构成与计算口径</a>）与实际税单各持有订单引用，两者之间建立一对一的核销记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 预收与实缴的逐单核销台账&#10;CREATE TABLE duty_receivable_ledger (&#10;  order_id          TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  market            TEXT      NOT NULL,&#10;  prepaid_amount    NUMERIC(14,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  prepaid_currency  TEXT      NOT NULL,&#10;  actual_amount     NUMERIC(14,4),&#10;  actual_currency   TEXT,&#10;  settled_at        TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  variance_amount   NUMERIC(14,4) GENERATED ALWAYS AS&#10;                      (COALESCE(actual_amount,0) - prepaid_amount) STORED,&#10;  variance_reason   TEXT,&#10;  guarantee_ref     TEXT,&#10;  CONSTRAINT non_negative_prepaid CHECK (prepaid_amount &gt;= 0)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 按品类与口岸观察系统性偏差&#10;SELECT m.market, m.hs_chapter,&#10;       AVG(r.variance_amount) AS avg_var,&#10;       PERCENTILE_CONT(0.95) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY r.variance_amount) AS p95_var,&#10;       COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE r.variance_reason IS NULL) AS unclassified_cnt&#10;FROM duty_receivable_ledger r&#10;JOIN order_tax_meta m USING (order_id)&#10;WHERE r.settled_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 30&#10;ORDER BY p95_var DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 预收与实缴的逐单核销台账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> duty_receivable_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prepaid_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prepaid_currency  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_currency   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settled_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variance_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                      (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(actual_amount,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prepaid_amount) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variance_reason   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guarantee_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> non_negative_prepaid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prepaid_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按品类与口岸观察系统性偏差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hs_chapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">variance_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_var,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">variance_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_var,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">variance_reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unclassified_cnt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_receivable_ledger r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_tax_meta m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">settled_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_var </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二个查询是这套台账的核心用途：按市场与 HS 章切片看偏差分布，<code>unclassified_cnt</code> 暴露未归因的差异——未归因比例高说明归因规则有缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"浮存收益与它的合规边界\">浮存收益与它的合规边界</h2><p>预收与实缴之间的时间差会产生浮存（float）。在改善现金流的意义上这是 DDP 的真实财务价值之一，但它有两条边界必须写清楚。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，浮存规模受结算周期限制。</strong> 缩短结算周期降低解资压力，但同时提高保证金与担保成本——两者是同一枚硬币的两面，优化目标是总成本最低，不是浮存最大。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，预收税款不能被当作可投资的营运资金。</strong> 它是定向负债，投向受限。把预收税款用于一般营运支出，在资金紧张时会直接导致无法按期缴税，进而影响担保资格。这条约束应当体现在资金池的分账规则上，由系统强制执行而不是靠约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其他环节的接缝\">与其他环节的接缝</h2><p>预收金额的准确性依赖 <a href=\"../landed-cost-estimation/front-estimate-confidence-badge\">前台预估精度与可信度展示</a> 定下的可信度分级；实缴金额的来源是申报侧的税单，其字段规范与清关流程见 <a href=\"../../customs-label-logistics-docs/\">040 报关单证系统工程</a>；担保责任落在谁身上取决于代理关系形态，见 <a href=\"customs-broker-responsibility\">DDP 下报关行与履约商责任划分</a>；若某市场不存在可用的代收或简化征收通道，垫资成本会显著上升，判断依据见 <a href=\"../landed-cost-estimation/deminimis-threshold-ioss-dmp-link\">小额免税门槛与代收通道衔接</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>资金链四个时点：下单预收（形成负债）、出运垫付或提供担保（形成敞口）、清关完成（按实际税单调整负债）、周期末与申报方轧差（核销）。</li>\n<li>担保额度按周期内最大累计敞口加安全裕度估算，裕度应来自历史改判幅度的上分位，而不是拍脑袋。</li>\n<li>担保能力是 DDP 的准入条件：拿不到额度或成本吃光毛利时，该市场不可行。</li>\n<li>预收与实缴必须逐单核销并保留到覆盖追征期，否则差异归因会失去订单粒度。</li>\n<li>浮存是 DDP 的真实财务价值之一，但预收税款是定向负债，不能当作可投资的营运资金。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇把「谁在申报单上签字、出问题谁担责」讲清楚，见 <a href=\"customs-broker-responsibility\">DDP 下报关行与履约商责任划分</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DDP 税费预收、保证金与结算","id":"ddp-税费预收-保证金与结算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"资金链的四个时点","id":"资金链的四个时点"},{"level":3,"text":"时点一：下单，向买家预收","id":"时点一-下单-向买家预收"},{"level":3,"text":"时点二：出运，向申报方垫付或提供担保","id":"时点二-出运-向申报方垫付或提供担保"},{"level":3,"text":"时点三：清关完成，形成实际税单","id":"时点三-清关完成-形成实际税单"},{"level":3,"text":"时点四：结算周期末，与申报方轧差","id":"时点四-结算周期末-与申报方轧差"},{"level":2,"text":"保证金与担保：覆盖的是什么","id":"保证金与担保-覆盖的是什么"},{"level":3,"text":"担保额度怎么估","id":"担保额度怎么估"},{"level":3,"text":"担保能力是 DDP 的准入条件","id":"担保能力是-ddp-的准入条件"},{"level":2,"text":"预收税款的账务与系统处理","id":"预收税款的账务与系统处理"},{"level":3,"text":"科目设计","id":"科目设计"},{"level":3,"text":"逐单核销的必要性","id":"逐单核销的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"浮存收益与它的合规边界","id":"浮存收益与它的合规边界"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他环节的接缝","id":"与其他环节的接缝"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DDP vs DDU/DAP 选择与转化影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion"},"next":{"title":"DDP 下报关行与履约商责任划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/ddp-ddu-mode/customs-broker-responsibility"}}